        "text": "Sure—here are some genuinely useful accessories. **If you’re still using your iPhone 13 Pro**, these are good options:\n\n- **Protective case or wallet case:** Look for raised edges around the screen and cameras. Choose MagSafe compatibility if you want to use magnetic chargers or mounts.\n- **Tempered-glass screen protector:** Adds inexpensive protection against scratches and some impacts.\n- **20W USB-C charger and USB-C–to–Lightning cable:** A convenient fast-charging setup. Choose an Apple or reputable third-party charger and an MFi-certified Lightning cable.\n- **Portable power bank:** A 10,000mAh model is handy for travel and family days out. Wired charging is usually faster and more efficient than wireless.\n- **Phone stand or grip:** Useful for video calls, following recipes while cooking, or viewing sheet music while playing.\n- **Car mount:** Keeps navigation visible without holding your phone. Set your route before driving.\n- **Compact tripod:** Great for family photos and recording your piano, ukulele, or synth playing.\n\n**My first picks would be a protective case, screen protector, and power bank.** What phone are you using now, and what’s your budget?"
